title: "GH-1134: required collection recovery omits truthful --clear-* intent"
description: "GitHub #1134 shows that strict required-field refusals suggest only value-bearing collection flags or progressive mode even though --clear-deps and the other --clear-* flags are the truthful considered-empty answer, steering agents toward fabricated context edges."
