acceptance_criteria: Required collection failures map each supported collection to its exact --clear-* considered-empty flag; suggested_flags rank the truthful clear intent before value-bearing or policy-bypass alternatives; examples explain both empty and populated forms without invented identifiers; structured recovery and human diagnostics remain contract-parity; SDK CLI MCP completions and docs expose the same semantics; executable negative controls prove every advertised recovery succeeds without dangling or fabricated data; focused acceptance transcript and exact repository coverage gates pass
