resolution: Mapped every strict required collection to its truthful clear flag and ranked considered-empty recovery before value-bearing alternatives across generated contracts and diagnostics.
expected_result: A missing required collection refusal advertises the exact truthful considered-empty flag first and every suggested recovery is executable.
actual_result: "Strict create refusals now advertise executable clear-first recovery without fabricated graph data, with generated error catalogs and refusal census synchronized."
component: required-field recovery bundles and create option policy
customer_impact: Agents following first-party recovery guidance can permanently pollute the context graph with false edges that appear fully provenance-backed.
